res:curation_pc_to_ps_v01 a mslm:CurationRecord ; mslm:curationStatus mslm:Reviewed ; mslm:reviewedOn "2026-08-30"^^xsd:date ; mslm:reviewNote "Reactome class-level headgroup exchange; RHEA:45088 is cross-referenced by Reactome. Acyl-chain preservation is not asserted." .
