res:curation_ps_to_pe_v01 a mslm:CurationRecord ; mslm:curationStatus mslm:Reviewed ; mslm:reviewedOn "2026-08-30"^^xsd:date ; mslm:reviewNote "Reactome human event is based on rat evidence and limited human PISD data. Acyl-chain preservation is not asserted." .
res:curation_pe_to_pc_v01 a mslm:CurationRecord ; mslm:curationStatus mslm:Reviewed ; mslm:reviewedOn "2026-08-30"^^xsd:date ; mslm:reviewNote "Reactome class-level methylation with explicit 3:3 SAM/SAH stoichiometry. Acyl-chain preservation is not asserted." .
